  "description": "Minjeong is sick and tired of living with her childhood trauma. Being a daughter of a murderer… It’s the memory she wishes to erase. She abandons her name, Minjeong Kim and starts a new life as Seon-Yong Do. However, the victim who had the whole family killed by Seon-Young’s father attacks her! When Seon-Young regains her consciousness, she finds herself at a hospital in 1995, the very day her father committed the first murder!   \n(From KENAZ's website)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/56717139), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4116002023), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000058136), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9968133), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/9645), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/7365)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/117543), S.Chinese",
